rked, set())` with a fresh empty set, so duplicate zero-mark rows for the same unmarked owner are both silently dropped. The adversarial duplicate is then reported as `candidate_structure_complete=true`, `owner_equivalence_proven=true`, and `after_pass=true`. Track consumed unmarked owners across the loop and reject duplicate/extra zero-mark ownership, with a focused negative test.\n\nVerification at this SHA: targeted 14 = 9 accepted / 5 safe rejections; 340 = 335/340; 249 = 249/249; combined = 584/589; all four replay commands passed; issue-1645 tests 14/14, issue-1639 tests 38/38, issue-1641 suites 8/8 and 6/6 passed; all 20 compact artifact hashes and all four adjudication freeze bindings matched; no unresolved inline review threads; CI was still queued at final inspection.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1646#pullrequestreview-4744911688","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1646","author_association":"OWNER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1646#pullrequestreview-4744911688"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1646"}},"submitted_at":"2026-07-21T13:10:32Z","commit_id":"9a9aec9f838743b127e863cc243c1c0697a69f3a"},{"id":4744976448,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOO5D6p88AAAABGtKYQA","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizat